message: "If you use this work, please cite it."
title: "The Mass Gap of Pure SU(N) Gauge Theory as a Finite-Aperture Effect"
abstract: "Pure SU(N) Yang-Mills has a mass gap because the vacuum is read through a finite aperture, which band-limits: the gap is the entropy margin below the counting floor kappa_0 = (1/4) ln 3. The repository holds the paper, the Lean 4 / Mathlib verification, and the Entroptics analysis code."
